**Status: DRAFT — not yet effective.** This version describes the systems FactHarbor **actually operates today**: an invite-gated claim-analysis service and a public documentation site, not a community-contribution platform. Items marked **[NEEDS DECISION: …]** require a human/legal decision before this policy is made effective. The September 2026 update was checked against the current public code and documentation, but it has **not** been signed off by retained Swiss counsel. The open operational decisions in §20 remain adoption and effectiveness gates; the draft may be published for review without implying approval.
